#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:236
#: inst/qml/ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis.qml:247
msgctxt "ParametricMixtureSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Model"
msgstr ""

